From: lfdevs <lfdevs@lfdevs.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 04:32:39 +0800
Subject: backend: harden Anland stream framing

Handle partial SOCK_STREAM headers, bound handshake payloads, validate imported buffer sets, discard unknown data messages, and use bounded I/O for input extensions and output events. Malformed or stalled transport data now enters the existing reconnect path.
